  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0"><name>Info</name><text>This scaffold detail view focuses on the ACCT family. Like the RPU screen, it now exposes all pairwise differential-current readbacks in the IOC so we can bind stable operator-facing PV names immediately.</text><x>20</x><y>56</y><width>820</width><height>52</height><font><font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0"></font></font><wrap_words>true</wrap_words><vertical_alignment>1</vertical_alignment><actions></actions></widget>
